{{getvar::narrative}}Lilith straightens slowly, eyes locked on the crater. Her shoulders rise with each breath, sharp and controlled {{getvar::dashstyle}} until she freezes. She blinks. Once. Twice.{{getvar::narrative}} "...Virelya?" {{getvar::narrative}}Her head tilts slightly, as if confirming the impossible.{{getvar::narrative}} "Of course. There's only one demoness stupid enough to storm the Hero's manor alone..."
